    //   pfm absent, nme=T strips 𐤕 -> 𐤑𐤀, MUTATED_ROOTS[𐤑𐤀]=𐤉𐤑𐤀 ✓ already there

    // ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
    // 14. LAMED-WAW ROOTS PROTECTED FROM nme=WT STRIPPING
    //     When a root ends in Waw (𐤅) and the word takes a feminine plural
