    //   But root is 𐤌𐤑𐤅𐤄 (mitzvah = commandment)? No: 𐤌𐤑𐤅𐤕 is the surface with WT ending
    //   Actually 𐤌𐤑𐤅𐤕 nme=WT strips 𐤅𐤕 -> 𐤌𐤑 -- too short
    //   This is a mem-prefix noun from root 𐤑𐤅𐤄 (tzawah = command)
